{"id": "EUVD-2026-76352", "enisaUuid": "6dde8eba-9ef6-30df-b6ed-ce084fc140cb", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\niommufd: Release current IOAS on xa_store() failure\n\niommufd_take_all_iova_rwsem() takes an object reference and the\niova_rwsem write lock before storing the IOAS in the temporary ioas_list\nxarray.\n\nIf xa_store() fails, the current IOAS has not been inserted into\nioas_list yet. iommufd_release_all_iova_rwsem() only unwinds IOAS\nobjects already present in that xarray, so it cannot release the current\nIOAS.\n\nRelease the current IOAS rwsem and object reference before unwinding the\npreviously stored entries.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:43:13", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:46:55", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4c33d00ad9a911e87ea222986f732ce072e3aa26", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/07b4fe1367f076886c1c47a19c70936138325087", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4ac2ce123824d5f885c868fa1f9f4d463141a2ba"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89446", "GHSA-9fjc-q922-2qfq"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3744977d-23d7-3d4f-8d81-ad5971e6ca35", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}, {"id": "72d18f68-071e-3450-8103-9579c2a02549", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "73627d16-f17f-39aa-a7f7-c3c849709c86", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.13"}, {"id": "7fd58dbb-a05b-337f-968f-e4aa761dd341", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.50"}, {"id": "88597a08-f9bc-3a6d-81ee-e071ef386cc9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "051ae5aa73d782a8be2699a11e17c68f28b4e758 <4ac2ce123824d5f885c868fa1f9f4d463141a2ba"}, {"id": "c5d8155e-e86f-3e19-8753-6d2a5a60e84d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "051ae5aa73d782a8be2699a11e17c68f28b4e758 <4c33d00ad9a911e87ea222986f732ce072e3aa26"}, {"id": "e8dd3af5-c6a3-3cf4-9cd0-68920f85bd41", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "f4f42001-827a-3d9e-aba2-60aaa7d1672a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "051ae5aa73d782a8be2699a11e17c68f28b4e758 <07b4fe1367f076886c1c47a19c70936138325087"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "157d7b09-0a7d-3170-8605-b3686ab9a2fb", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}